  "projectName": "GradGather (BridgeU)",
  "projectDescription": "GradGather (branded as BridgeU) is a full-stack alumni networking platform that connects students and alumni for mentorship, networking, events, club participation, and donations, built with Node.js, Express, Handlebars, and MongoDB.",
